{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_07",
  "title": "有客先来",
  "storyCode": "RI-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "749ea8b0b428f302529a8e81e44365ebb27291386b34605bf50da738babdfa8a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "居然有这么强的整合运动，哼，但是小刻不会输的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "啧，这个傻丫头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "醒醒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "唔？这里是哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "啊，是嘉维尔！还有大家！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "早上好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "text": "诶嘿嘿，博士早上好。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "text": "唔，博士的脸色有点可怕，是我做错了什么吗？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "text": "博士不要生气好不好......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "（爆栗）",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "text": "呜呜呜，头好痛，博士。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "text": "为什么突然敲我的头呀......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "精神看起来至少恢复正常了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "小刻，你还记得你怎么来到这里的吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "text": "......唔，忘了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "好吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "来，你先躺下，我给你看看身体还有没有出问题，还有下次别乱跑了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "text": "好~咦，这里是哪里啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "这里是......啧，不知道怎么给你解释，反正躺好就对了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "text": "哦——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嘉维尔，你在搞什么鬼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "啧，给你解释也很麻烦，总之你先等等。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "十分钟后"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "好了，没什么大碍，去博士旁边待着，别乱跑啊，再乱跑不给你蜜饼吃了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "text": "哦！蜜饼！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "可以了吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "可以了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "那么，嘉维尔，你在搞什么鬼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "唉，说起来有些复杂，总之我是来找你的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "引擎我是不会还给你的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "虽然引擎也是一件事，不过我有别的事要找你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "别的事？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "你是不是让手下去开采铁矿了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "......啧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嘉维尔，我没想到你是这么不服输的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "被大丑打败让你不服气吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "不，那个叫大丑的东西确实不赖，我心服口服。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "但如果你不惜让手下染上矿石病也要去开采矿石的话，那我作为医生，就必须要阻止你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嗯？矿石病？哦，你在说石头病。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我没有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我告诉过他们很多次不要靠近矿区深处。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "可是你的手下明明感染了矿石病！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "会有不听话的家伙跑进去，这个我拦不住，你说是吧，尤吉？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "尤吉",
          "text": "是，哥哥是想多给大酋长采一些矿才冒险跑进矿区深处的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "啊？那你早说啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "尤吉",
          "text": "你又没问。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "这么重要的事......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你自己说的，矿石病在这里不被重视。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "text": "啧，好吧。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "text": "博士，我该不会真的没问吧？！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你确实没问。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "text": "啧，博士，连你也拆我的台！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "而且......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "喂，你干嘛突然脱衣服？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "嗯？！你的身体......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我从小就一直在矿区里到处跑，会得石头病也是很正常的事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "但是，我也敢说，没有人比我更了解矿区里哪里有那种会让人得病的矿石。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "这样啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "好吧，那是我错怪你了，抱歉哈，祖玛玛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "没事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "text": "诶，就这么和解了？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "text": "一般这种情况不是应该互不相让然后大战三百回合的吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可颂",
          "text": "别期待这种事啦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嘉维尔不是那种人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可惜。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "那我们来聊聊另一件事吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "我们的引擎在你这里对吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嗯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "那个能不能还给我们？不然的话我可要回不去了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你想回去的话，我可以让人送你一程。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "那可不行，凯尔希会生气的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "无论如何都不行？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "无论如何都不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "text": "哦，看起来还是要打诶。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "看起来还是要动手啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我从一开始就是这个打算。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "嘿，要和这家伙打一场吗，有意思！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "嗨，你们好！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......大祭司，你怎么这就把大丑开出来了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "什么，不是要和嘉维尔动手吗？不用吗？不用我就开回去了，我还要测试引擎呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......要，但不是现在，我还有话要说。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，好吧，那你先说，要打了喊我！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嗯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "喂，刚才你们是不是提到了引擎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "没错，大丑身上现在就装着你的引擎，想要的话，就用你的武力来抢吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "嘿，那就来吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "跟我来，我们在广场上决出胜负。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
